 libctk-dev,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Medical Imaging Interaction Toolkit - development files
 The Medical Imaging Interaction Toolkit (MITK) is a free open-source
 software system for development of interactive medical image processing
 software.
 .
 This package contains the headers needed to build software against the
 MITK module libraries.

